9
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.200
Yeah I'm Richard Carter
from the University of York,

10
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.280
the Old York from the United Kingdom.

11
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.440
And this presentation
