12
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.880
in mind, partly artistic,
but also partly engineering and focus.

13
00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.600
And essentially it's called kite drone.

14
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.240
As the name suggests,

15
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.440
it's a very deliberate fusion of old
and new technologies to consider along

16
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.000
the kind of themes I've done in the past
