19
00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.600
What would we learn?

20
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.040
What other stories would be
told through these systems?

21
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.000
This project is somewhat adjacent
to electronic literature.

22
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.680
It's doing a bit

23
00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.440
more than perhaps what you might think of
as a typical elite project,

24
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:08.320
but it has got elements that resonate, 
