193
00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:52.520
You have the visual scene and you can see
the different machine vision boxes.

194
00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.640
You can click on them and you can follow
through some of the materials

195
00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:59.960
that the system thinks is most appropriate
