00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:10.400
using it instead of a drone
to gather environmental data.

218
00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.720
Indeed, it may even be desirable.

219
00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:16.600
It's unlikely to achieve that aim, but
that's part of the esthetic aspirations,

220
00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:19.840
this idea of imagining another world
and imagining another world.

221
00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.280
Seriously.
All right then, let's make it happen.

222
00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.520
Let's actually see what it would do,
what it would look like,

223
00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:27.840
what are the challenges
