00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.360
It's kind of accessible to anyone.

230
00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.120
As a broadcast stream.

231
00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.280
I'd love to be able to do performances
with this apparatus.

232
00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.680
Once it's up in the air,
there's a gathering of us.

